<doc id="92342" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=92342" title="Florence and the Machine">
Florence and the Machine

Florence and the Machine (utawa Florence + the Machine) ya iku sawijining grup musik indie saka Inggris kang anggotané &lt;a href="Florence%20Welch"&gt;Florence Welch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Isabella%20Summers"&gt;Isabella Summers&lt;/a&gt;, uga kolaborasi karo musisi liyané. Grup iki olèh aprésiasi lan dipuji karo média musik sadurungé kondhang, salah sawijiné ya iku &lt;a href="BBC"&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;. BBC akèh mènèhi kontibusi kanggo grup iki amarga ngréwangi anggoné promosi kang dadi péranganing &lt;a href="BBC%20Introducing"&gt;BBC Introducing&lt;/a&gt;.
Grup iki duwé album debut sing diwènèhi judhul &lt;a href="Lungs"&gt;Lungs&lt;/a&gt; kang rilis 6 Juli 2009 lan bisa nggayuh posisi loro ing limang minggu awal ing &lt;a href="UK%20Albums%20Chart"&gt;UK Albums Chart&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika 17 Januari 2010, album iki bisa olèh papan nomer siji sawisé 28 minggu. Oktober 2010, album iki ana ing top-forty United Kingdom sawisé 65 minggu lan bisa dadi album paling laris antaraning taun 2009-2010. Album studio ke-2, &lt;a href="Ceremonials"&gt;Ceremonials&lt;/a&gt;, rilis nalika Oktober 2011, dadi nomer siji ing UK lan nomer enem ing US.
Musiké Florence and the Machine diandharaké minangka kombinasi saka manéka warna génre, kalebu &lt;a href="rock"&gt;musik rock&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="soul"&gt;musik soul&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Lungs"&gt;Lungs&lt;/a&gt; bisa olèh &lt;a href="MasterCard"&gt;MasterCard&lt;/a&gt; British Album award ing &lt;a href="2010%20BRIT%20Awards"&gt;2010 BRIT Awards&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika &lt;a href="53rd%20Grammy%20Awards"&gt;53rd Grammy Awards&lt;/a&gt;, Florence and the Machine dadi nominasi ing &lt;a href="Grammy%20Award%20for%20Best%20New%20Artist"&gt;Best New Artist&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané, grup iki tampil ing &lt;a href="2010%20MTV%20Video%20Music%20Awards"&gt;2010 MTV Video Music Awards&lt;/a&gt;, lan the 2010 &lt;a href="Nobel%20Peace%20Prize%20Concert"&gt;Nobel Peace Prize Concert&lt;/a&gt;.

