<doc id="92425" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=92425" title="Angel Trains">
Angel Trains

Alpha Trains (sadurungé tanggal 1 Januari 2010: Angel Trains International) iku sawijining firma transportasi Inggris sing nyewakaké wahana-wahana transportasi ril (basa Inggris: Rolling Stock Operating Company (utawa dicekak dadi ROSCO)). Sawisé &lt;a href="British%20Rail"&gt;British Rail&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="PT%20Kereta%20Api"&gt;PT Kereta Api&lt;/a&gt;-né Britania diswastanisasi, Angel Trains banjur ngoper alih materialé British Rail. Firma panyéwan liyané saka Inggris ya iku &lt;a href="Porterbrook"&gt;Porterbrook&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="HSBC%20Rail"&gt;HSBC Rail&lt;/a&gt;. Angel Trains ndarbèni kurang luwih 5.000 wahana rèl.
Kantor punjeré ana ing London, lan saliyané iku firma iki ndarbèni cabang ing &lt;a href="Antwerpen"&gt;Antwerpen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Derby"&gt;Derby&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%B6ln"&gt;Köln&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Madrid"&gt;Madrid&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Roma"&gt;Roma&lt;/a&gt;.
Angel Trains iku suwé naté dadi darbèné Bank Britania &lt;a href="Royal%20Bank%20of%20Scotland"&gt;Royal Bank of Scotland&lt;/a&gt;, sing nuku Angel Trains ing taun 1997 saka &lt;a href="Nomura%20Holdings"&gt;Nomura Holdings&lt;/a&gt;. Ing sasi Juni 2008 didol marang firma Australia &lt;a href="Babcock%20%26amp%3B%20Brown"&gt;Babcock &amp; Brown&lt;/a&gt; Infrastructure, sing nuku firma iki kanggo € 4,7 milyar.
