<doc id="92749" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=92749" title="Resaba">
Resaba

Resaba (&lt;a href="Sanskerta"&gt;Sanskerta&lt;/a&gt;: ऋसभ; Ṛṣabha) wonten salebeting &lt;a href="agama%20Hindhu"&gt;agama Hindhu&lt;/a&gt;, minangka awatara &lt;a href="Wisnu"&gt;Wisnu&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kaping wolu saking kalih dasa inkarnasi. Resaba ugi dipunsebataken wonten salebeting &lt;a href="Markandeya"&gt;Markandeya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wayu"&gt;Wayu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brahmanda"&gt;Brahmanda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Skanda"&gt;Skanda&lt;/a&gt; saha &lt;a href="Purana%20Wisnu"&gt;Purana Wisnu&lt;/a&gt;. Pasinaon ingkang saged dipunpendhet inggih punika ngajaraken tiyang agesang manawi bandha punika saged damel drengkining penggalih.

