CD-ROM asipat "maos kemawon" inggih punika namung saged kawaos ananing boten saged dipunserati. Supados saged maos isining CD-ROM, piranti utama ingkang dipunbetahaken inggih punika &lt;a href="kandar%20CD"&gt;kandar CD&lt;/a&gt;. Miturut pangembangan jaman CD-ROM sapunika wonten ingkang saged dipunserati malih (Re-Write/Rw) ingakng langkung kawentar kanthi sebutan &lt;a href="CD-RW"&gt;CD-RW&lt;/a&gt;.
