Tlawah Labuh.
1990-1994: Miwiti Suksés.
Nalika Andrea lan Caroline sekolah, Jim lan Sharon miwiti duo grup band ingkang manggung ing sajrine kafè kagungane sadulur. Bapaké saderek Corrs, Gerry, énggal miwiti latihan damèl band ingkang sajrone kulawarga. Rikala 1994, sarampunge Andrea lan Carolin rampung sekolah, The Corrs wiwit diwiwiti dadi band.
Nalika badhé medal 1994, the American Ambassador kanggo nagari Irlandia, &lt;a href="Jean%20Kennedy%20Smith"&gt;Jean Kennedy Smith&lt;/a&gt;, ngungdang The Corrs kanggo manggung nalika &lt;a href="1994%20FIFA%20World%20Cup"&gt;1994 FIFA World Cup&lt;/a&gt; ing kutha &lt;a href="Boston"&gt;Boston&lt;/a&gt; sabanjuré mirsani The Corrs manggung ing Whelan's Music Bar kutha &lt;a href="Dublin"&gt;Dublin&lt;/a&gt; After an appearance at the &lt;a href="1996%20Summer%20Olympics"&gt;1996 Summer Olympics&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href="Atlanta%2C%20Georgia"&gt;Atlanta, Georgia&lt;/a&gt;, United States,
