1995-1999: Miwiti Rekaman.
&lt;a href="Jason%20Flom"&gt;Jason Flom&lt;/a&gt;, saka &lt;a href="Atlantic%20Records"&gt;Atlantic Records&lt;/a&gt;, dhawuhi The Corrs supaya tindhak menyang &lt;a href="David%20Foster"&gt;David Foster&lt;/a&gt;, musisi saka nagari Kanadha, &lt;a href="Record%20producer"&gt;producer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="composer"&gt;composer&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="arranger"&gt;arranger&lt;/a&gt;. The Corrs bnajur manggung kanggo Foster, banjur piyambake gelem damel rekaman kaliyan The Corrs. The Corrs banjur urip namung 5 wulan ing Amérikah Sarékat kanggo rekaman album kapisan&lt;a href="Forgiven%2C%20Not%20Forgotten"&gt;Forgiven, Not Forgotten&lt;/a&gt;.
